# END Firefox icons

# Mozilla's illustrations that draw Firefox's fox or a Firefox or Mozilla
# product logo, wherever Sval still shows them, take a Lucide glyph for what the
# surface is about, or Sval's own mark. docs/firefox-assets.md lists every
# Firefox image Sval could show and what happens to each;
# test_sval_firefox_assets.js holds this list to it.
% override chrome://browser/skin/addons/extensions-panel-empty-illustration.svg chrome://browser/content/sval/illustrations/puzzle.svg
% override chrome://global/skin/illustrations/no-connection.svg chrome://browser/content/sval/illustrations/unplug.svg
% override chrome://global/skin/illustrations/security-error.svg chrome://browser/content/sval/illustrations/shield-alert.svg
